  "body": "Tucked privately back from Deep Creek Road, this substantial block-and-brick home delivers space, versatility and sweeping sea views in a location that’s hard to beat. Located opposite Deep Creek Reserve and just down the road from Torbay School, with Waiake Beach, Browns Bay Beach, shops and everyday amenities all within easy reach, this is a setting that makes life wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is generous living, opening to large decks where the sea views take centre stage. The lounge is warm and inviting with a cosy Kent woodburner, while the kitchen and dining area opens to a large conservatory, giving you plenty of options for relaxed everyday living and entertaining. Also on this level are two bedrooms, a beautiful family bathroom and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nDownstairs adds wonderful flexibility, with generous living spaces opening to another conservatory, decks and garden. A bedroom and tiled bathroom provide an ideal retreat for teenagers, guests or extended family, while the double garage includes a separate office space, perfect for working from home, hobbies or extra storage. The home benefits from two heat pumps providing year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for a solid, spacious home with genuine versatility, great outdoor living and a view that will keep drawing you outside, this one is well worth a look.",
